;;;; Colombia — one-off national holidays decreed on top of the statutory list.
;;;;
;;;; Ley 51 de 1983 (Ley Emiliani) art. 1–2 fixes the national holidays and
;;;; the ones moved to the following Monday; those are rules in
;;;; colombia-holidays-calendar, not data.
;;;; https://apps.procuraduria.gov.co/gd_1952/docs/l0051_83.htm
;;;; https://www.funcionpublica.gov.co/eva/gestornormativo/norma.php?i=4954
;;;;
;;;; Empty: Colombia has no annual decree "puentes". The entries this file
;;;; used to hold (Independencia puente 2024-07-22 / 2025-07-21 / 2026-07-21,
;;;; Navidad puente 2024-12-16 / 2025-12-15 / 2026-12-14, Inmaculada puente
;;;; 2024-12-09 / 2025-12-08, "Decreto 555 of 2024") have no legal basis:
;;;; 20 July and 8 December are fixed under Ley 51/1983, and no such decree
;;;; exists (#15). Removed in 0.12.0 (#14) before the registered "CO"
;;;; calendar started applying this file.
;;;; Format: ((:year Y :authority A :uri U :holidays (((Y M D) "Name") …)) …)

()
